#
# The web images build from this directory, so the context is pruned here as well as at
# the repository root. The paths are spelled out as well as globbed, because the packer
# that uploads a build context to a remote builder does not always honour a leading `**/`.

**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.env
**/.env
**/.memory-store.json
**/.memory-seeded.json

node_modules/
web-shared/node_modules/
*/storefront-web/node_modules/
*/merchant-web/node_modules/
*/storefront-web/.next/
*/merchant-web/.next/
